{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/events\/sessionkey"]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Records","title":"Records","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SourceLocation","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"text":" key of the session an event was tracked in: a random identifier that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Enricher.sessions(timeout:kinds:)"},{"text":" (module ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sessions"},{"text":") sets on every record’s context.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"symbolKind":"enum","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SessionKey","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration","modules":[{"name":"Events"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"SessionKey.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Events\/SessionKey.swift#L24"},"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SessionKey"}],"externalID":"s:6Events10SessionKeyO","title":"SessionKey","role":"symbol"},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/15Instrumentation0A10ContextKeyP","doc:\/\/Events\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Events\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SessionKey","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SessionKey"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination reads it from each record’s context:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let session = record.context[SessionKey.self]  \/\/ a UUID"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The identifier is a version 7 UUID: its first 48 bits are the session’s start, the timestamp"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of its first record, in Unix milliseconds, and the other 74 bits that aren’t the version and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"variant are random, never derived from the device, the user or another identifier. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enricher keeps it in memory only, so a new tracker, as on the next launch, starts a new session"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with a new identifier."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A store keeps it beside each record of the session, as part of the record’s own bytes, and it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is deleted when the store deletes the record’s bytes (a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SegmentStore"},{"type":"text","text":": once its whole segment"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is delivered). So a record recovered after a relaunch carries the session it was tracked in,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and a destination sends it under the same identifier as before. It is the only part of a record’s context a store keeps, and a store never keeps"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it apart from a record."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Type-Aliases","title":"Type Aliases","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/SessionKey\/Value"]},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/